velop scales and look very  reptilian much like a dragon for those  reasons it's only appropriate that billy  fights one of them off using the sword  hanging on the wall by his front door  it's just like his drawing however the  majority of the gremlins end up in the  movie theater with all the ranting from  mr futterman about gremlins getting into  the machinery and causing biplanes to  crash during world war ii it is only  fitting that the americans get back at  them with a big explosion  if you want to see me cover gremlins 2  let me know in the comments this is the  last video of this year but they're  going to be plenty more next year  remember to subscribe to cz's world for  new horrors every week ring that jolly  death bell and select all notifications  otherwise you're getting coal in your  stocking and also you'll die and i'll  see you next year assuming we both  survive  [Music]
 

